cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mcmc3r Bench: an independent bilingual GUI for mcmc3r"
version: 0.1.0
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zeng
    given-names: Zichao
    alias: 曾子超
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6553-970X"
    email: zengzichao@sjtu.edu.cn
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZengZichao/mcmc3r-Bench"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - phylogenetics
  - MCMCtree
  - BPP
  - divergence times
  - marginal likelihood
  - calibration density
  - Shiny
  - bilingual
abstract: >-
  mcmc3r Bench is an independent, unofficial bilingual Shiny GUI for the
  mcmc3r R package. It wraps calibration-density exploration, MCMC output
  summaries, and marginal-likelihood estimation with validation, light/dark
  themes, English/Chinese text, and reproducible exports.
